
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Novidade Disponível</title>

<style>
*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}

body{
  min-height:100vh;
  min-height:100svh;
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at center,
      #2c1907 0%,
      #100b07 45%,
      #050505 100%
    );
  color:white;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:24px;
}

.container{
  width:100%;
  max-width:440px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  text-align:center;
  gap:30px;
}

.tag{
  color:#ffd46a;
  background:rgba(255,180,40,.10);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,180,40,.35);
  border-radius:50px;
  padding:12px 22px;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:1px;
}

h1{
  font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,45px);
  font-weight:900;
  line-height:1.15;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  text-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,160,0,.15);
}

h1 span{
  color:#ffb52a;
}

.btn{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  width:100%;
  max-width:370px;
  min-height:65px;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:18px;
  color:#171000;
  background:linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    #ffe16b,
    #ff9b00
  );
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:900;
  text-decoration:none;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 20px rgba(255,160,0,.45),
    0 0 45px rgba(255,140,0,.18);
  animation:pulse 2s infinite;
  transition:transform .2s;
}

.btn:active{
  transform:scale(.96);
}

.btn:focus-visible{
  outline:3px solid white;
  outline-offset:4px;
}

@keyframes pulse{
  0%,100%{
    box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,160,0,.45);
  }
  50%{
    box-shadow:
      0 0 35px rgba(255,160,0,.85),
      0 0 60px rgba(255,140,0,.30);
  }
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .btn{
    animation:none;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="container">

  <div class="tag">
    ✨ NOVIDADE DISPONÍVEL
  </div>

  <h1>
    UMA NOVA EXPERIÊNCIA
    <span>CHEGOU!</span>
  </h1>

  <a
    class="btn"
    href="https://serivan2025.github.io/Golden_Time/"
  >
    🔥 DESCOBRIR AGORA
  </a>

</main>

</body>
</html>
